{:edb/db-before-t 2541 :edb/db-after-t 2542 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535854 50 #inst "2026-10-09T09:02:57.057Z" 13194139535854 true] [17592186133689 1020 #edb/ref 17592186370507 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1017 #edb/ref 17592186370508 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1089 "q-141159" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1100 "Consider the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨\\,\\cdot \\,,\\,\\cdot \\,⟩$ over $C.$ \nWhich of the following statements are true? \n\n- $⟨a,b⟩=⟨b,a⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$\n- $⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩$ for any $a,b\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in R$\n- $⟨a,a⟩>0$ for any $a\\in {C}^{n}$" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1113 #uuid "6920e043-98c8-591f-ba7e-c0a9f1bbfc02" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370507 1145 "Recall that the standard Hermitian inner product over $C$ satisfies the following properties:\n\n- It is linear in the first argument. For any $a,b,c\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C,$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a+b,c⟩=⟨a,c⟩+⟨b,c⟩\\,$ and $\\,⟨\\alpha a,b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩.$\n\n- It is antilinear in the second argument. For any $a,b,c\\in {C}^{n}$ and any $\\alpha \\in C,$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,b+c⟩=⟨a,b⟩+⟨a,c⟩\\,$ and $\\,⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\overset{―}{\\alpha }⟨a,b⟩.$\n\n- It has conjugate symmetry. For any $a,b\\in {C}^{n},$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,b⟩=\\overset{―}{⟨b,a⟩}.$\n\n- It is positive-definite. For any $a\\in {C}^{n},$ we have\n\n$\\,$ $⟨a,a⟩$ is a non-negative real number, and $⟨a,a⟩=0$ if and only if $a=0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statement I is false. The inner product over $C$ has conjugate symmetry.\n\n- Statement II is true. For any $\\alpha \\in R,$ we have $\\overset{―}{\\alpha }=\\alpha .$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n⟨a,\\alpha b⟩=\\overset{―}{\\alpha }⟨a,b⟩=\\alpha ⟨a,b⟩.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Notice that if $a=0,$ then $⟨a,a⟩=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370509 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370510 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370511 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370512 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370513 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1041 "selection" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1104 #edb/ref 17592186370513 13194139535854 true] [17592186370508 1110 #uuid "a589bdb3-81ae-5bb4-9120-de1332971711" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370509 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370509 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535854 true] [17592186370509 1111 #uuid "f0a725b9-f580-5784-b0b9-e149e4e72fb0" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370510 1034 "I only" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370510 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535854 true] [17592186370510 1111 #uuid "4982bee4-e258-5bee-ac44-60ecfa556299" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370511 1034 "III only" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370511 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535854 true] [17592186370511 1111 #uuid "a1ee4366-02d0-5ffc-ad7e-97da5bd8acbf" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370512 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370512 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535854 true] [17592186370512 1111 #uuid "37b67e26-88ae-54bc-ab2e-d4e87f9c340b" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370513 1034 "II only" 13194139535854 true] [17592186370513 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535854 true] [17592186370513 1111 #uuid "90651eaf-c146-532f-9cb5-80f591989c27" 13194139535854 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-141159" 17592186370507 "q-141159/selection" 17592186370508 "q-141159/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" 17592186370509 "q-141159/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" 17592186370510 "q-141159/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" 